# UniXNU/components.toml 的 PaganiBt 条目（已在主线），阶段 4 改这几行，其余不动。这个文件这轮只由主线改。revision 填带 drivers/PaganiBt 新文件的 UniXNU-Pagani-Drivers 提交。
function = "OnePlus 13T Bluetooth: power-up of the peach BT subsystem (rails with the UFS-safe S7I rules, rfclka1, sleep clock, BT_EN), GENI UART in FIFO polling mode, IBS, the Android 0x31 peripheral/TME-L/BT firmware download, an LE scan self test, and the bridge to the real bluetoothd (the com.apple.uart.sk.bluetooth kernel control, the bluetooth service, a local answer for every vendor command, guards that withdraw it all)"
board_dependencies = ["Stage7Probe calls pagani_bt_start", "pagani-bt=N (absent: off)", "BT firmware in place on bluetooth_a and modem_a (never in the image)", "stage 4: com.apple.bluetoothd enabled in the Data seed and the two text fix-ups of integration/text-fixups.txt"]
source_files = ["PaganiBt.cpp", "PaganiBtHost.cpp", "BtBridge.c", "BtBringup.c", "BtDownload.c", "BtFirmware.c", "BtFat.c", "BtGeni.c", "BtH4.c", "BtIbs.c", "BtPmic.c", "BtStandIn.c", "BtTlv.c"]
